direction: right

title: "report の呼び出しは判定の7つの関門を通ったときだけ描かれ、\n違反は欄を直す戻り道でモデルへ返る" {
  near: top-center
  shape: text
  style.font-size: 36
  style.bold: true
  style.font-color: "#e6edf3"
}

classes: {
  node: {
    shape: rectangle
    width: 320
    height: 110
    style: {
      fill: "#1f2a37"
      stroke: "#5b7a99"
      font-color: "#e6edf3"
      border-radius: 8
      font-size: 24
    }
  }
  backnode: {
    shape: rectangle
    width: 320
    height: 110
    style: {
      fill: "#3a2312"
      stroke: "#ff8a3d"
      stroke-width: 3
      font-color: "#ffd9b8"
      border-radius: 8
      font-size: 24
    }
  }
  back: {
    style: {
      stroke: "#ff8a3d"
      font-color: "#ffb36b"
      stroke-width: 3
      stroke-dash: 4
      font-size: 18
    }
  }
  fwd: {
    style: {
      stroke: "#7fb4ff"
      font-color: "#cfe3ff"
      stroke-width: 2
      font-size: 18
    }
  }
}

model: モデル側 {
  style: {
    fill: "#16202c"
    stroke: "#6c8fb3"
    font-color: "#9fc2e6"
    font-size: 22
    border-radius: 12
  }
  call: |md
    **モデル**

    report を呼ぶ
  | {class: node}
  fix: |md
    **直して渡し直す**

    直す欄だけ
  | {class: backnode}
}

server: サーバ {
  style: {
    fill: "#16251f"
    stroke: "#5fa88a"
    font-color: "#9fdcc0"
    font-size: 22
    border-radius: 12
  }
  check: |md
    **形の検査**

    省いた欄は引き継ぐ
  | {class: node}
  judge: |md
    **判定**

    7つの関門を上から順に
  | {
    class: node
    style.stroke: "#7fb4ff"
    style.stroke-width: 5
    style.fill: "#243b5a"
  }
  pass: |md
    **通す**

    endTurn を付ける
  | {class: node}
  rec: |md
    **記録**

    引数のまま持つ
  | {class: node}
}

browser: ブラウザ {
  style: {
    fill: "#251f2e"
    stroke: "#a58ad0"
    font-color: "#cdb8ee"
    font-size: 22
    border-radius: 12
  }
  fmt: |md
    **整形**

    落としても同じ行だけ
  | {class: node}
  draw: |md
    **欄ごとに描く**
  | {class: node}
  bubble: |md
    **吹き出し**

    closing を出す
  | {class: node}
}

stop: |md
  **Stop の関所**

  report 無しで止まろうとしたとき
| {class: backnode}

model.call -> server.check: 引数を渡す {class: fwd}
server.check -> server.judge: 揃った引数 {class: fwd}
server.judge -> server.pass: 違反なし {class: fwd}
server.pass -> server.rec {class: fwd}
server.rec -> browser.fmt {class: fwd}
browser.fmt -> browser.draw {class: fwd}
browser.draw -> browser.bubble {class: fwd}

server.judge -> model.fix: 違反あり {class: back}
model.fix -> server.check: 呼び直す {class: back}
stop -> model.call: report で渡し直させる {class: back}
